        "text-align": "justify"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Overview",
      "text_hash": "d4b1ea5708dd532930a85188b45aff6f0a3ed458500c7577e0127a538eb0d100",
      "type": "heading_candidate"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000058-0c6683ca",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[70]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 58,
      "reported_page": 3,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "120%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "As our founders Larry and Sergey wrote in the original founders' letter, \"Google is not a conventional company. We do not intend to become one.\" That unconventional spirit has been a driving force throughout our history, inspiring us to tackle big problems and invest in moonshots. It led us to be a pioneer in the development of artificial intelligence (AI) and, since 2016, be an AI-first company. We continue this work under the leadership of Alphabet and Google CEO, Sundar Pichai.",
      "text_hash": "0c6683ca3ecc8367796b5d5934b2864ce71d473e85fbba2b931887e8144790c8",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000059-ab2556c8",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[71]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 59,
      "reported_page": 3,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": {
        "font-family": "'arial',sans-serif",
        "font-size": "10pt",
        "font-weight": "400",
        "line-height": "115%",
        "margin-top": "6pt",
        "text-align": "justify",
        "text-indent": "22.5pt"
      },
      "table": null,
      "text": "Alphabet is a collection of businesses — the largest of which is Google. We report Google in two segments, Google Services and Google Cloud, and all non-Google businesses collectively as Other Bets. Supporting these businesses, we have centralized certain AI-related research and development focused on advanced research in AI and developing the frontier models that serve our businesses, which is reported in Alphabet-level activities. Alphabet's structure is about helping each of our businesses prosper through strong leaders and independence.",
      "text_hash": "ab2556c8c13f84c98da87bfca59a6ac497b3b7fe3850f9bc849621e872e9dddc",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
